361069,"user_name":"松鼠工作室","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2071802,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"1B3C858399FE53","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1f/9c/fa/0b9d9832.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1667181982,"is_pvip":true,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"老师你好，我看了你不少的专栏和文章，然后上面看到你说你想补充的是给大家一条主线，通过这条主线去抓住各项知识，我可以不可以这么理解\n1. 你所说的主线，其本质上，就是成长，一个程序猿的成长，从一个写代码到一个写好代码的程序员，这就是所谓的“道”\n2. 你教的各种提高效率，或者代码规范之类的，这些都是“术”\n我不知道可不可以这么理解，如果我理解有偏差，还请老师讲解一下，在这门课程中或者在你其他的课程中，所谓的主线是什么？所谓的大树的树根是什么？\n什么是树根，什么又是树叶？\n我们学习之树应该如何的快速的成长，又如何的培养自己强大的根茎，让树叶都能开的茂盛些？","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":341575,"user_name":"起风了","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1110574,"ip_address":"","ucode":"DEA3B47B7F3C3F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f2/2e/cb647708.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1649718832,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"人要负责将业务问题和机器执行连接起来，缺少了业务背景是不可能写出好代码的。","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":300580,"user_name":"zenk","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1013669,"ip_address":"","ucode":"B235D5EBCF49BC","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/77/a5/c5ae871d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1625224709,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"对，取好名字前提是问题分解的干净合理","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":195502,"user_name":"时代先锋","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1856411,"ip_address":"","ucode":"956E3E6A6A4F30","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/53/9b/d0a21378.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1585191696,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":2,"score":3,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"代码书写是程序员沟通得语言","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":92484,"user_name":"whhbbq","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1018494,"ip_address":"","ucode":"4A93F3E375CB44","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1557281098,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"【实际上，我们很多没写好的程序有一些原因就是名字起错，把一些概念混淆在一起了】\n根本原因是概念混淆，老师讲出了为啥没有起好名字的深层次原因，受教受教！我之前理解的起一个好名字还是低了一个层次。\n","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":392687,"user_name":"ifelse","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2550743,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"D0565908C99695","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/26/eb/d7/90391376.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1721537803,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":3,"score":4,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"学习打卡","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":347068,"user_name":"二饼","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2415448,"ip_address":"","ucode":"48120565D135F7","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/db/58/a7a0a85b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1653663678,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"这篇真的常看常新，我已经读了很多遍了，每次都有不同的感受。\n作为一个初入职场的开发者，我对于好命名的理解也从不是abc，到一个具体的描述，再到一个符合英语语法能准确描述做什么。\n不过迫于英语水平很一般，因此目前真正能实践的到的程度也仅限于描述在做什么（不怎么考虑英语语法）。\n再结合老师这篇文章，也发现目前的命名喜欢或许细节，而不具体，这个也是我以后要首先改善的方面。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":342621,"user_name":"ubuntuMax","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2438569,"ip_address":"","ucode":"242CAEC0FD9C77","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/25/35/a9/5f309b81.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1650367181,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"代码本身能讲清业务逻辑是最好的，除非特别复杂的算法，一般还是把注释想说的话以代码本身来展现。\n其实写代码和写文章是类似的，都是要表达清晰，文达。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"